&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

</jpcrp030000-asr_E05066-000:DescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnHumanResourceDevelopmentAndImprovementOfInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndResultsUsingSuchMetricsMetricsAndTargetsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E05066-000:MetricsAndTargetsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
